Hi Thomas,

quick update on your mail from yesterday re week 47.

I spoke to Wagner this morning. They can ship the first partial
delivery (pallets 1-6) on Thursday, the rest will follow early next
week. The delay is on the freight forwarder's side, not the goods
themselves.

Let me know by tomorrow noon whether we can plan on that, or whether
we need to cover the rest through Scholz at short notice. I'd need
the current demand sheet from production for that.

Thanks and regards
Maria

